WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.166
Your agent shipped the change.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.705
The reviewer still has to imagine it.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.713
Don't describe the change. Show it.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.047
The agent implements the change,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.022
collects real evidence: the behavior before, and after,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:25.927
then LeClap validates the template, and composes the video. Composition, not generation.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.702
Your workflow attaches it to the pull request.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.620
Before: a faint link, and no feedback.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.373
After: one button, and the cart opens.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.508
And one clear thing to review.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.976
Lights, camera, merge.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.591
LeClap.
